     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I've seen this before. It’s related to tomcat not being cleanly shutdown usually. Could it be that there were previous sessions which were not cleanly shut down as per ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://www.devdummy.com/2017/10/resolved-javaiostreamcorruptedexception.html"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": "  ? ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "If this is being seen on a clean fresh tomcat container then the issue lies elsewhere and needs further investigation. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
