     "body": "<p>I've seen this before. It’s related to tomcat not being cleanly shutdown usually. Could it be that there were previous sessions which were not cleanly shut down as per <a href=\"https://www.devdummy.com/2017/10/resolved-javaiostreamcorruptedexception.html\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://www.devdummy.com/2017/10/resolved-javaiostreamcorruptedexception.html</a>  ? </p>\n\n<p>If this is being seen on a clean fresh tomcat container then the issue lies elsewhere and needs further investigation. </p>",
